#. Plugin Name of the plugin/theme
msgid "BuddyPress Member Reviews"
msgstr "BuddyPress Évaluation des Membres"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin/theme
msgid "https://wbcomdesigns.com/downloads/buddypress-user-profile-reviews/"
msgstr "https://wbcomdesigns.com/downloads/buddypress-user-profile-reviews/"

#. Description of the plugin/theme
msgid ""
"This plugin  allows only site members to add reviews to the buddypress "
"members on the site. But the member can not review himself/herself. And if "
"the visitor is not logged in, he can only see the listing of the reviews but "
"can not review.  The review form allows the members to even rate the "
"member's profile out of 5 points with multiple review criteria.."
msgstr ""
"Ce plugin permet aux membres du site d'ajouter des évaluations sur les "
"membres du site. Mais le membre ne peut pas se réviser lui-même. Et si le "
"visiteur n'est pas connecté, il peut voir la liste des commentaires, mais ne "
"peut pas évaluer. Le formulaire d'évaluation permet aux membres de classer "
"même le profil du membre sur 5 points avec des critères multiples..."

#. Author of the plugin/theme
msgid "Wbcom Designs"
msgstr "Wbcom Designs"

#. Author URI of the plugin/theme
msgid "https://wbcomdesigns.com"
msgstr "https://wbcomdesigns.com"
